partcad-bosl2
=============

This PartCAD package generates parts from BOSL2, the Belfry OpenSCAD Library v2.

The code in this repository (the `bosl2_repo.py` repository plugin, the PartCAD
configuration and the tests) is:

    Copyright 2026 PartCAD
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

BOSL2 itself is NOT included in this repository. It is downloaded on demand from
its upstream project at build time:

    BOSL2 - The Belfry OpenSCAD Library, v2
    https://github.com/BelfrySCAD/BOSL2/
    Copyright the BOSL2 authors.
    Licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License.

BOSL2's own license (BSD 2-Clause) applies to the downloaded BOSL2 source and to
the geometry it produces. See the BOSL2 repository for the full license text.
